  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Regional Emergency Health Preparedness in the Pacific and Timor Leste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports the National Critical Care and Trauma Response Centre (NCCTRC) to strengthen disaster medical preparedness and response capacity in the Pacific region and Timor-Leste through the Regional Engagement Program. The program delivers training, mentoring, leadership activities and support across Emergency Medical Teams (EMTs), clinicians, allied health professionals, managers and emergency responders, leveraging Australian skills, regional bodies and national leaders.</narrative>
  </description>
